      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "<p><span lang=\"EN\">This is the copy of the letter that will be sent to Lord Cowan General</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN\">Because it has been decided and laid down as a condition, by the State of England which is an ally of the Sublime [Ottoman] State, that the exchange of certificates/letters of confirmation of public affairs in France&hellip;. from the date of&hellip; will be discharged/released by [military forces?]&hellip;.</span></p>",
